  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Directions and indications",
   "texto": [
    "To ask for help on the street in an educated way: «Kunt u mij helpen?» (Can you help me?). The basic addresses are: «rechtdoor» (all right), «links» (left), «rechts» (right). The separate verb «oversteken»: «steek daar de straat over» is used to cross the street (cross the street). For reference points: «de eerste hoek» (first corner), «de tweede hoek» (second corner), «de brug» (bridge)."
   ]
  },
